  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">The Sprint Backpack is made for daily commutes and busy days. Crafted of Signature canvas and smooth leather, this backpack features an inside tech sleeve, inside zip, cell phone, and multifunction pockets, and outside zip and flap pockets for ample organization. The top handle and luggage sleeve add extra convenience.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Sprint Backpack In Signature Canvas With Patches</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Recycled polyester lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Drawstring and snap closures</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside zip, cell phone and multifunction pockets</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">11.25&quot; (L) x 18.00&quot; (H) x 6.50&quot; (W)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Top handle with 3.25\\&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
